# The Gradle wrapper (gradlew, gradlew.bat, gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar)
# is tracked deliberately, against the Flutter template's default: it is how a
# fresh clone builds with the right Gradle version, and the submission zip is
# assembled from tracked files.
/.gradle
/captures/
/local.properties
GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

